The entries under log/ are a personal practice record. They are NOT covered by the
Apache-2.0 licence at the repository root, nor by the CC BY 4.0 licence that covers the
written content of this project.

This is deliberate. Creative Commons grants are irrevocable: a published version can
never be un-licensed, whatever is deleted later. The machinery of this repository is
meant to be adopted, extended and rebuilt on. The record of one person's practice is not.

Reuse of the machinery needs no permission. Reuse of these entries does.
